[ti:Aɣrib]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Les Deux Compères]
[length:7:42]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:17.02] Mačči seg wul i kem-ǧǧiɣ
[00:27.76] Imi ur d am-in-rriɣ
[00:31.35] Lejwab ɣef tebrat-inem
[00:45.29] Ḥeḍren leḥbab mi ɣliɣ
[00:59.04] Ass-n mi tt-ɣriɣ
[01:02.54] Rḥan-iyi lehḍur-inem
[01:14.65] Kerheɣ lektiba ad tt-waliɣ
[01:22.15] D leqlam bḍiɣ
[01:25.92] Aẓaṛ izdeɣ-it ssem
[01:37.40]
[01:51.47] Yeḥzen lemri deg i muqqleɣ
[02:09.68] Ass mi kem-ctaqeɣ
[02:13.88] Udem-iw ṛẓag i tmuɣli
[02:26.28] Am uzekḍuf ay uɣaleɣ
[02:42.84] Ɛeṛqeɣ i wid ssneɣ
[02:46.49] Qqaren-d ma d keččini
[02:58.62] Ṣbeṛ ay axxam deg i d-luleɣ
[03:05.57] Am wass-a ad n-aseɣ
[03:09.62] D lmektub ad aɣ-id-iwali
[03:29.10]
[03:36.99] Ul-iw meskin ihujer
[03:41.70] Ay icerreg lebḥer
[03:43.88] Kul aṭṭan yezdel fell-as
[03:48.29] Yuɣal sellaw seg uḥebber
[03:52.02] Ay aṭas ay iṣbeṛ
[03:54.65] Ɣef tin ɛzizen fell-as
[03:58.11] Yecfa ass mi akken i as-id-ittaxxer
[04:00.78] Tebɣa ad t-id-teḍfer
[04:02.98] Teẓṛa lɣerba d mm-txidas
[04:06.98] Mi meqqreḍ ad k-id-tḍeqqer
[04:09.47] Temẓi-k ad tt-tenker
[04:11.65] Ad ak-tedleq mebla tuɣmas
[04:15.75]
[04:23.84] D lɣerba i d i-ikellxen
[04:27.96] Ay d temẓi-w yeccḍen
[04:30.13] Ass mi tt-id-teqsed taluft
[04:34.24] Imal wul sanda niḍen
[04:38.00] Yettu i iṣaṛen
[04:40.10] D tinna akken iǧǧa di tmurt
[04:44.15] Meskint fell-as ay terhen
[04:46.45] Lxiq d leḥzen
[04:48.83] Tɛemmed i temẓi-s ad tfut
[04:52.63] Leɛwam la ttemseḑfaren
[04:55.44] Qqnent-iyi wallen
[04:57.33] Ttuɣ ɣuṛṛeɣ-d tameṭṭut
[05:01.12]
[05:09.36] Tɛemmdeḍ i rregmat irkel
[05:13.34] Tekniḍ-as i ddel
[05:15.55] Yessusi ssem ɣef temẓi-m
[05:19.55] S ugudu beddleɣ laṣel
[05:23.12] Yeffeɣ-iyi leɛqel
[05:25.29] Rehneɣ ula d amur-im
[05:29.30] Ɛecr-snin tisin tebṭel
[05:31.63] Aḍaṛ-iw yenfel
[05:34.01] Reggment-kem tezyiwin-im
[05:38.08] Ass-a lḥif yeččur ṣṣḑel
[05:40.39] Azekka ad yenɣel
[05:42.54] Ad d-tebren teḍṣa s udem-im
[05:46.72]
[05:54.62] Yiwen wass uqbel lɛica
[05:58.67] Ad n-beddeɣ s teḍṣa
[06:00.76] Ad am-kkseɣ ineẓman
[06:04.56] Ad n-afeɣ teɛmer lǧamaɛ
[06:08.29] Wa ad yeqqar i wa
[06:10.48] Ma d flan i-d-yennulfan
[06:14.49] Mi ḥeqqen akk d nekk aya
[06:17.08] Yak ur jaḥeɣ ara
[06:19.17] Ad tekfu teḍṣa n wuglan
[06:23.23] Iḑelli heddren merra
[06:25.56] Qqaren-as d ccmata
[06:27.76] Isellem ula deg yimawlan 
[06:31.77]
[06:39.53] Ur yessikkid ḥedd taɛrurt-is 
[06:43.80] Yettwali lğar-is 
[06:45.84] Iɣil leɛyub-is şşṛen 
[06:49.72] Ur ilehhu d ccɣel-is 
[06:53.57] Ad yezyen yisem-is 
[06:55.60] Yettṣeggid wid i t-yifen 
[06:59.38] Tineggura ɣer yiɣef-is 
[07:02.12] Mi yeṛṛeẓ yiccew-is 
[07:04.32] D nndama ara t-id-iṣaḥen 
[07:08.16] Ad yettɣeẓẓiz accaren-is
[07:10.77] Mi ara iẓeṛ lḥeqq-is 
[07:12.72] Uwin-as-t wid yeṭṭuṛcen
[07:16.47] Ad yettɣeẓẓiz accaren-is
[07:19.02] Mi ara iẓeṛ lḥeqq-is 
[07:21.08] Uwin-as-t wid yeṭṭuṛcen
[07:24.67] Ad yettɣeẓẓiz accaren-is
[07:27.28] Mi ara iẓeṛ lḥeqq-is 
[07:29.41] Uwin-as-t wid yeṭṭuṛcen
[07:32.94]